  "_README": [
    "Photographs for the California 100 trips, each from Wikimedia Commons under a licence that",
    "allows reuse with credit (CC0, public domain, CC BY, CC BY-SA). The page prints the credit",
    "the licence asks for under every picture — author, licence, a link to the Commons page.",
    "of.kind is trip or course; role is hero (one per trip, the page's and the unfurl card's",
    "picture), course (a picture of that course, or of its place when the caption says so) or",
    "gallery. The files live in public/california/photos at 1100px wide. Validate insists every",
    "file exists, every licence is one of those, every of.slug resolves, and each trip has one hero.",
    "The caption is ours; the source block is Commons's."
